pacity/source only; not original nonlinear Grackle or a global error certificate. Adaptive `rtol=1e-8` uses 5166 halfsteps and has absolute survivor difference `9.49e-11/H`, not a free speedup. Time-dependent spectral and native chemical source matching remain separate unresolved obligations.\n\nAll new 10 published source/test/report/raw numerical Git blobs were independently fetched and their original git-blob hashes matched after a diagnosed missing-final-newline upload repair. C10 reproducible package, stage receipts, full report, NCP Codex handoff and next DAG are under `research/rei_positive_age_reference_20261016/`.\n\n## Dual independent preservation and limitations\nR5/C6/C8/C10 phase archives were **each uploaded to Google Drive and ChatGPT Library**, then full-file materialized independently from both (8/8 exact SHA256, CRC, per-member manifest PASS). The C10 archive was freshly extracted separately from *each* provider: full 34/34 tests, numerical result recreation and figure replay all exit 0. Combined `REI_POSITIVE_AGE_REFERENCE_C10_20261016_v2.zip` SHA256 `ea045f2484c2f93cca52d114331717c4d156e23cf034331d04daf1be5cbce00d`, 318228 bytes, 29 science payloads plus manifest; [Drive file](https://drive.google.com/file/d/1YvQYscb_QS4O8BK01OXXay2c0OsSWWjJ/view). Metadata `DELIVERY_RECEIPT_v2.json`; latest DAG `contracts/NEXT_DAG_v3.json`. **Dropbox new-stage upload NOT_VERIFIED**, since its current connector does not accept this session's directly generated container artifact; original PR166 own double-cloud backup remains unaffected.\n\nCurrent Wolfram app connection was unavailable (one context + one evaluator diagnostic), so no new Wolfram CAS PASS is claimed; historical R5 equality `{0,0,1,0}` was previously executed and reused. No host-native subagents exposed. `PRODUCTION_SCIENTIFIC_ADMISSION=NOT_ISSUED`.\n\n## Next action\n`SOURCE_AGE_NATIVE_POSITIVE_REFERENCE_INTAKE`: external Codex reads `CODEX_NCP_HANDOFF_KO.md`, inspects latest original PR150 and P